{"495910": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Dungeon Fighter Online", "steam_appid": 495910, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "dlc": [2492771, 2492770], "detailed_description": "With fast-paced gameplay and unique side scrolling 2D action, <i>Dungeon Fighter Online (DFO)</i> is an Action-anime MORPG played by over 500 million players worldwide.<br><br>Delve into the fantasy adventure with an epic story line and a variety of characters!<br>You are the hero of the next adventure!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/495910/extras/e6ee22ef7a5ce41a494353faea676f5b.avif?t=1785840765\" width=610 height=200 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Retro-style</strong></h2>Dungeon Fighter Online is a 2D side-scrolling action game inspired by classic arcade games such as Golden Axe and Double Dragon.<br>If memories of playing good ol' games like Street Fighter gives you nostalgia, and want to indulge yourself into a similar experience, this is the game for you!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/495910/extras/6bebced609258ef96c0baf14c5693520.avif?t=1785840765\" width=620 height=208 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Incredible Hit Effects and Spectacular Combos</strong></h2>Like a true action game, Dungeon Fighter Online showcases dazzling hit effects and complex combos! Easy to learn but hard to master!<br>Also, there are beautiful illustrations for each class which adds more fun to your gaming experience!* <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/495910/extras/8bdb665bab3f0a8f2e2158e8c18704ed.avif?t=1785840765\" width=610 height=208 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dynamic Customization</strong></h2>DFO allows you to customize your character with various types of avatars. Dyes are available so that you can color and personalize<br>your avatars, giving yourself a unique look!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/495910/extras/2baee71d5a42dde016da3484d0de1430.avif?t=1785840765\" width=610 height=208 /></span>", "about_the_game": "With fast-paced gameplay and unique side scrolling 2D action, <i>Dungeon Fighter Online (DFO)</i> is an Action-anime MORPG played by over 500 million players worldwide.<br><br>Delve into the fantasy adventure with an epic story line and a variety of characters!<br>You are the hero of the next adventure!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/495910/extras/e6ee22ef7a5ce41a494353faea676f5b.avif?t=1785840765\" width=610 height=200 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Retro-style</strong></h2>Dungeon Fighter Online is a 2D side-scrolling action game inspired by classic arcade games such as Golden Axe and Double Dragon.<br>If memories of playing good ol' games like Street Fighter gives you nostalgia, and want to indulge yourself into a similar experience, this is the game for you!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/495910/extras/6bebced609258ef96c0baf14c5693520.avif?t=1785840765\" width=620 height=208 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Incredible Hit Effects and Spectacular Combos</strong></h2>Like a true action game, Dungeon Fighter Online showcases dazzling hit effects and complex combos! Easy to learn but hard to master!<br>Also, there are beautiful illustrations for each class which adds more fun to your gaming experience!* <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/495910/extras/8bdb665bab3f0a8f2e2158e8c18704ed.avif?t=1785840765\" width=610 height=208 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dynamic Customization</strong></h2>DFO allows you to customize your character with various types of avatars. Dyes are available so that you can color and personalize<br>your avatars, giving yourself a unique look!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/495910/extras/2baee71d5a42dde016da3484d0de1430.avif?t=1785840765\" width=610 height=208 /></span>", "short_description": "Get ready for the ultimate brawl! Dungeon Fighter Online is a classic beat-em up 2D action game with an epic storyline and RPG elements! Choose from 17 diverse classes, and unravel ancient mysteries as you punch, slash, shoot, or summon your way to victory!", "supported_languages": "English", "reviews": "“Dungeon Fighter Online has proven itself to be a timeless classic and the love and support shown by the game’s developers only proves that this game should have never disappeared in the first place. With its heavily skill-based combat, excellent PvP structure and old school vibe, DFO is a game that every fan of beat ‘em ups and fighting games alike should try out. Despite some of its issues, the pros definitely outweigh the cons on this. I don’t tend to speak highly of F2P games these days, but this one in particular gains my highest recommendation.”<br>4/5 – mmohuts<br><br>“From first-time gamers to experts of both the fighting and MMO game styles, Dungeon Fighter Online has aspects and techniques ready to ensure a good experience for a massive range of people. With such selections available, it is easy to see why so many people continue to play Dungeon Fighter, and even easier to see why people would come back time and again to play new characters and try out even more aspects of the game.”<br>mmorpg<br><br>“The connection Neople has made with its English-speaking community is unprecedented, and it may be one of the reasons the game makes it to launch and (hopefully) succeeds. This is how communicating with consumers should be: Completely organic.”<br>gameskinny<br>", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/495910/eff8f6b74316448fcfbbcbcee9a38834fe85ee30/header.jpg?t=1785840765", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/495910/0eb605c9de4004413b6221a46da05ddad0b8ec78/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1785840765", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/495910/0eb605c9de4004413b6221a46da05ddad0b8ec78/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1785840765", "website": "http://www.dfoneople.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Microsoft Windows 7 64-bit or higher<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Pentium Gold or higher, AMD Athlon or higher<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel UHD Graphics 610 or higher, AMD Radeon Vega 3 or higher<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 40 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Microsoft Windows 10 64-bit or higher<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5 or higher, AMD Ryzen 5 or higher<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1050 Ti or higher, AMD Radeon RX 580 or higher<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 40 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "legal_notice": "ⓒ Neople, INC. All Rights Reserved. All trademarks referenced herein are the properties of their respective owners.", "developers": ["Neople"], "publishers": ["Neople"], "package_groups"